// F6 (kernel weakness): chamfer/rounding of the edges of a plane fails when a convex
// edge ends at a short concave one (step in front of a high wall): „chamfer failed:
// SM_ERR (1001)“; `mcad render --line 5` shows the concave edge in red. Likewise: rib feet with
// short outer edges (heat sink), top edges of the front compartment (pen box).
// Status (report 13): open – SMLib corner type convex/concave; message marks the edge.
// SOLL: fehlerfrei
chamfer(0.5) {
    difference() {
        union() {
            cube([40, 30, 20]);
            translate([0, 20, 0]) cube([40, 10, 50]);
        }
        translate([3, 3, 3]) cube([34, 17, 30]);
    }
    translate([20, 15, 20]) cube([60, 60, 0.5], center = true);
}
